  "goodToKnow": "Die Halbinsel is a half-island, so a peninsula: die Iberische Halbinsel (Spain and Portugal), die Halbinsel Krim, die Arabische Halbinsel. It's a transparent compound, halb plus Insel. It's feminine, like die Insel. In Germany, the Halbinsel Eiderstedt on the North Sea coast and the island of Rügen are popular holiday spots, though Rügen is, of course, a whole island."
